{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18849","headline":"墙阴歌 · 刘禹锡","name":"墙阴歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日左右浮天潢，朝晡影入东西墙。\n昔爲儿童在阴戏，当时意小觉日长。\n东邻侯家吹笙簧，随阴促促移象牀。\n西邻田舍乏糟糠，就影汲汲舂黄粱。\n因思九州四海外，家家只占墙阴内。\n莫言墙阴数尺间，老却主人如等闲。\n君看眼前光阴促，中心莫学太行山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}